          Custom Digital Marketing Strategies for Six Delhi Clinical Segments
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-[13.5px] sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-left sm:text-justify sm:hyphens-auto sm:[text-align-last:left]">
          Whether you lead a 300 bed super speciality hospital, an IVF and maternity network or specialised diagnostic labs, we connect clinical expertise directly with patients.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Columns x 2 Rows Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-7">
